@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title GET /api/workspace/v1/messenger/files/{file_uuid}/actions/download
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "控制器 RestAlchemy" as API
database "文件元数据 + ACL 在 PostgreSQL" as DB
database "配置文件存储器" as STORE
Client -> API: GET 下载
API -> DB: 索引式元数据 + 检查 ACL
DB --> API: locator 储存器 + hash
API -> STORE: 读取不可更改的字节
STORE --> API: 字节
note right of API: 没有 outbox / 任务 / 事件
API --> Client: 200 字节 + ETag
@enduml
